    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Killen is north Lauderdale County at its most characteristic — a community of families, farms, and practical homeowners who know value when they see it and skepticism when they smell a sales pitch. BamaClean has been the cleaning and restoration company of choice in this community for over three decades, building its presence entirely through word-of-mouth in a community where reputation travels fast and lasts long.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Killen's homes tend toward the rural residential character of Lauderdale County's north end: larger lots, a mix of 1970s–1990s brick ranch construction and newer development, and homes that sit on the kind of terrain that holds water after rain events. The Elk River drainage basin and the agricultural character of north Lauderdale County create moisture conditions in crawlspaces and around foundations that we address regularly. Killen homes that have never had a professional mold inspection are often the ones where we find the most substantial crawlspace growth during an initial visit.</p>
